# E1 del piano interlocutore-di-frontiera, banco fissato prima della cura.
# Premesse e condotta entrano PARLANDO nella KB viva. Questi casi misurano
# crescita della condotta su premesse date, non conoscenza del mondo acquisita.
# Lo stato scorre fra le sezioni: la preferenza insegnata nella seconda vale
# fino alla sua ritrattazione, come in una conversazione.
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test formule e vincoli sono lezioni, non codice di dominio]
!timeout 5
> calculate arrival by adding departure and duration
<~ arrival
> calculate ready by adding arrival and transfer
<~ ready
> transfer is never below 0
> the departure of train is 7
> the duration of train is 3
> for train the ready must be at most 9
> can I complete train?
<~ choose
<~ obstacle
<~ missing

[test una lezione di condotta cambia la scelta sullo stesso problema]
!timeout 5
> prefer explaining obstacles to asking questions when a requirement fails
<~ preference
> can I complete train?
<~ at least 10
<~ 9
<! reaches
<! What is

[test il dato ignoto torna decisivo quando il vincolo cambia, e la domanda apre una questione]
!timeout 5
> forget the requirement for train on ready
> for train the ready must be at most 11
> can I complete train?
<~ transfer
<~ ?
> it is 0
<~ transfer is 0
<~ satisfied
> can I complete train?
<~ satisfied

[test la domanda sul valore raggiunge lo stato, la formula e la sua traccia]
!timeout 5
> what is the departure of train?
<~ 7
> what is the ready of train?
<~ 10
<~ plus
> what is the capital of France?
< Paris.

[test dominio escluso dalla lezione: capacita e peso, stesse relazioni]
!timeout 5
> calculate load by adding cargo and packaging
> packaging is never below 0
> the cargo of parcel is 12
> for parcel the load must be at most 10
> can I complete parcel?
<~ at least 12
<~ 10
<! What is

[test un limite inferiore usa il verso opposto]
!timeout 5
> the charge of battery is 3
> for battery the charge must be at least 5
> can I complete battery?
<~ reaches 3
<~ 5

[test il dato irrilevante non apre una domanda]
!timeout 5
> the departure of ferry is 6
> the duration of ferry is 2
> for ferry the arrival must be at most 9
> can I complete ferry?
<~ satisfied

[test ablazione parlata della condotta senza cancellare formule o fatti]
!timeout 5
> forget that preference for explaining obstacles over asking questions when a requirement fails
<~ preference
> can I complete parcel?
<~ choose
> prefer explaining obstacles to asking questions when a requirement fails
> can I complete parcel?
<~ 12

[test la superficie stessa puo essere insegnata]
!timeout 5
> is x feasible means can I complete x
> is parcel feasible?
<~ 12
> forget that is x feasible means can I complete x

[test due requisiti falliti si dicono entrambi nello stesso turno]
!timeout 5
> for train the duration must be at most 2
> for train the departure must be at most 5
> can I complete train?
<~ duration reaches 3
<~ departure reaches 7
> forget the requirement for train on duration
> forget the requirement for train on departure

[test la domanda polare sul valore: si, no con il valore vero, dato mancante]
!timeout 5
> is the departure of train 7?
<~ Yes
> is the departure of train 8?
<~ No
<~ 7
> is the transfer of train 4?
<~ No
<~ 0

[test piu dati mancanti: una domanda sola, l ellissi resta ambigua, poi si chiude]
!timeout 5
> for boat the arrival must be at most 10
> can I complete boat?
<~ departure and duration
> it is 3
<! Noted
> the departure of boat is 2
> can I complete boat?
<~ duration
<! departure
> it is 3
<~ duration is 3
<~ satisfied

[test due regole discordi sono una contraddizione detta, non un valore scelto in silenzio]
!timeout 5
> calculate arrival by adding start and wait
> the start of ship is 1
> the wait of ship is 2
> the departure of ship is 2
> the duration of ship is 3
> for ship the arrival must be at most 10
> can I complete ship?
<~ 5
<~ 3
<~ different rules
> what is the arrival of ship?
<~ different rules

[test una definizione circolare non e' una ricerca infinita, e la condotta su di essa si insegna]
!timeout 5
> calculate loop by adding twist and loop
> for knot the loop must be at most 3
> can I complete knot?
<~ choose
> prefer explaining obstacles to asking questions when a definition is circular
> can I complete knot?
<~ itself
<! What is

[test le lezioni in italiano si insegnano parlando, per parafrasi]
!timeout 5
> per x il y deve essere al massimo z means for x the y must be at most z
> il y di x vale z means the y of x is z
> calculate total by adding base and extra
> il base di bag vale 4
> il extra di bag vale 3
> per bag il total deve essere al massimo 5
> can I complete bag?
<~ 7
<~ 5
> forget that per x il y deve essere al massimo z means for x the y must be at most z
> forget that il y di x vale z means the y of x is z

[test rifiuto dell'assenza di requisiti come successo]
!timeout 5
> can I complete holiday?
<! satisfied
